==English==

===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₂welh₁-|id=rule}}
{{etydate|1648}}; {{bor+|en|la-med|validātus||to validate|nocap=1}} (perhaps through {{bor|en|frm|valider}}), the {{glossary|perfect}} {{glossary|passive}} {{glossary|participle}} of {{m|la-med|validō}} (see {{af|en|-ate|id1=verb|pos1=verb-forming suffix}}), from {{af|la-med|validus|-ō|id2=denominative|pos2=verb-forming suffix|nocat=1}}. {{surf|en|valid|-ate|nocat=1}}.

====Pronunciation====
