====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[render]] [[valid]].
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To check or prove the [[validity]] of; [[verify]].
# {{lb|en|ergative}} To have its validity successfully proven.
#: {{ux|en|The data file cannot be imported because it doesn't '''validate'''.}}

